html:
{% set issue_dt = frappe.utils.getdate(doc.issue_date) %}
{% set day_num = issue_dt.day %}
{% if 11 <= (day_num % 100) <= 13 %}{% set suffix = 'th' %}{% else %}{% set suffix = {1: 'st', 2: 'nd', 3: 'rd'}.get(day_num % 10, 'th') %}{% endif %}
<style>
  @page {
    size: A4 portrait;
    margin: 12mm 15mm 12mm 15mm;
  }
  .xav-print-wrapper {
    font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;
    font-size: 9.6pt;
    line-height: 1.32;
    color: #000000;
  }
  .xav-header {
    text-align: center;
    border-bottom: 1.5px solid #000000;
    padding-bottom: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .xav-company-title {
    color: #0000FF;
    font-size: 14pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin: 0 0 2px 0;
    letter-spacing: 0.4px;
  }
  .xav-company-sub {
    font-size: 8.5pt;
    margin: 0;
    color: #111111;
  }
  .xav-meta-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    font-size: 9.2pt;
  }
  .xav-section {
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    text-align: justify;
  }
  .xav-sec-title {
    font-weight: bold;
    text-decoration: underline;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .xav-list {
    margin: 2px 0 4px 18px;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .xav-list li {
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .xav-sig-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-top: 14px;
    page-break-inside: avoid;
  }
  .xav-footer {
    margin-top: 10px;
    padding-top: 4px;
    border-top: 1px solid #999999;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 8pt;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #333333;
  }
  .page-break {
    page-break-before: always;
  }
</style>

<div class="xav-print-wrapper">
  <!-- PAGE 1: OFFICIAL INTERNSHIP OFFER LETTER -->
  <div class="xav-header">
    <div class="xav-company-title">XAVIRGIN (OPC) PRIVATE LIMITED</div>
    <p class="xav-company-sub">
      8/372, Ground Floor, Valiyaparambil, Edathala, Aluva, Ernakulam, Kerala - 683561<br/>
      CIN: U62090KL2025OPC098558 | Website: <a href="https://xavirgin.com">xavirgin.com</a> | LinkedIn: <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/xavirgin-com/">xavirgin-com</a>
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="xav-meta-row">
    <div>
      <strong>To: {{ doc.candidate_name }}</strong><br/>
      {% if doc.candidate_address %}{{ doc.candidate_address }}<br/>{% endif %}
      Email: {{ doc.candidate_email }}{% if doc.candidate_phone %} | Phone: {{ doc.candidate_phone }}{% endif %}
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <strong>Offer Ref:</strong> {{ doc.name }} (v{{ doc.offer_version }})<br/>
      <strong>Date:</strong> {{ frappe.utils.formatdate(doc.issue_date, "dd MMMM yyyy") }}
    </div>
  </div>

  <p style="margin: 4px 0;">Dear <strong>{{ doc.candidate_name }}</strong>,</p>
  <p style="margin: 4px 0 6px 0; text-align: justify;">
    We are pleased to offer you an unpaid educational internship opportunity with <strong>XAVIRGIN (OPC) PRIVATE LIMITED</strong> (the "Company"). This letter sets out the key terms, rules, and guidelines of your internship for your review and acceptance.
  </p>

  <div class="xav-section">
    <span class="xav-sec-title">1. Internship Role &amp; Learning Objective</span>
    <strong>Position:</strong> {{ doc.designation }}<br/>
    <strong>Nature of Engagement:</strong> {{ doc.employment_type or 'Unpaid, 90-Day Remote Internship' }}, intended solely as a practical learning experience and not constituting employment.<br/>
    <strong>Scope of Work:</strong> You will primarily work on Xavirgin's in-house products, tools, and systems. You will not be deployed on external client billable projects. The primary objective is to gain hands-on experience in <strong>{{ doc.skill_area }}</strong> through practical software development and business operations exposure.
  </div>

  <div class="xav-section">
    <span class="xav-sec-title">2. Duration, Attendance &amp; Extension Policy</span>
    <strong>Net Duration Requirement:</strong> {{ doc.active_working_days_required or 90 }} active working days (<strong>{{ frappe.utils.formatdate(doc.start_date, "dd MMMM yyyy") }}</strong> to <strong>{{ frappe.utils.formatdate(doc.end_date, "dd MMMM yyyy") }}</strong>).<br/>
    <strong>Leave Tracking &amp; Compensatory Days:</strong> The Internship Completion Certificate and Letter of Recommendation (LOR) will <strong>only</strong> be issued upon the successful completion of {{ doc.active_working_days_required or 90 }} full days of active participation. If you take approved leaves during the program (e.g., 5 days of leave), your internship duration will automatically be extended by that exact number of days (e.g., total duration becomes 95 calendar days) to fulfill the {{ doc.active_working_days_required or 90 }} active working days requirement.<br/>
    <strong>Initial Evaluation Period:</strong> The first <strong>{{ doc.initial_evaluation_days or 15 }} days</strong> will serve as an initial evaluation period to review your learning capability, communication, attendance, and adherence to Company rules.
  </div>

  <div class="xav-section">
    <span class="xav-sec-title">3. Schedule &amp; Team Sync Guidelines</span>
    <strong>Work Commitment:</strong> Minimum 4 hours per day (remote), 6 days a week (Sunday Off).<br/>
    <strong>Daily Meetings:</strong> Attendance at daily team syncs/learning reviews is mandatory. Standard meeting schedules are set at <strong>8:00 PM IST</strong> (approx. 40 minutes); however, daily meeting times may vary based on organizational requirements or project deadlines.<br/>
    <strong>Reporting:</strong> You will report to <strong>{{ doc.reporting_manager_name or 'Savio Babu' }}</strong> for task tracking and feedback.
  </div>

  <div class="xav-section">
    <span class="xav-sec-title">4. Certification &amp; Hardcopy Dispatch Policy</span>
    Upon successful completion of the {{ doc.active_working_days_required or 90 }} working days:
    <ul class="xav-list">
      <li><strong>Digital Certificate &amp; LOR:</strong> A digital PDF Certificate and Letter of Recommendation (LOR), digitally signed with the Company's Digital Signature Certificate (DSC), will be issued by default via email at zero cost.</li>
      <li><strong>Physical Original Certificates (Self-Pickup):</strong> You may collect the original physical certificate bearing the physical company seal and Director's signature directly from our registered office free of cost.</li>
      <li><strong>Courier Policy:</strong> The Company does <strong>not</strong> arrange or pay for domestic or international courier dispatches. If you require a physical hardcopy delivered to your address, you must schedule and pay for the courier/pickup service yourself. The physical hardcopy with the official company seal and Director's signature will then be handed over to your authorized courier.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="xav-section">
    <span class="xav-sec-title">5. Company Policies &amp; Mandatory Compliance</span>
    As an intern with Xavirgin, you are required to thoroughly read, understand, and strictly adhere to all official company policies and legal frameworks prior to commencing your internship:
    <ul class="xav-list">
      <li><strong>Legal Notice:</strong> <a href="https://xavirgin.com/legal-notice.html">xavirgin.com/legal-notice.html</a> | <strong>Privacy Policy:</strong> <a href="https://xavirgin.com/privacy-policy">xavirgin.com/privacy-policy</a></li>
      <li><strong>Workplace Policy:</strong> <a href="https://xavirgin.com/workplace-policy">xavirgin.com/workplace-policy</a> | <strong>Terms &amp; Conditions:</strong> <a href="https://xavirgin.com/terms-and-conditions">xavirgin.com/terms-and-conditions</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="xav-section">
    <span class="xav-sec-title">6. Unpaid Status &amp; Startup Disclaimer</span>
    Xavirgin is currently a small-scale startup focused on building its core products. This program is <strong>unpaid</strong> and does <strong>not offer job placements or employment guarantees</strong> upon completion. You are not an employee of the Company and are not entitled to wages, salary, or statutory benefits.
  </div>

  <div class="xav-section">
    <span class="xav-sec-title">7. Confidentiality &amp; Intellectual Property</span>
    You agree to treat all non-public Company code, credentials, SOPs, and system access as strictly confidential. You shall not upload or share Company repositories or materials on public platforms (e.g., GitHub, GitLab) without explicit written permission. All code developed during the internship remains the exclusive property of the Company.
  </div>

  <div class="xav-section">
    <span class="xav-sec-title">8. Exit &amp; Termination Rights</span>
    You may discontinue the internship after the {{ doc.initial_evaluation_days or 15 }}-day evaluation period with <strong>3 days</strong> written notice. The Company reserves the right to terminate the internship immediately in cases of repeated unexcused absences, breach of confidentiality, or failure to follow organizational policies.
  </div>

  <div class="xav-section">
    <span class="xav-sec-title">9. Acceptance</span>
    Please sign and return a scanned copy of this letter along with valid proof of identity within <strong>2 days</strong> (by <strong>{{ frappe.utils.formatdate(doc.acceptance_deadline, "dd MMMM yyyy") }}</strong>) to confirm your acceptance.
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 8px;">
    <strong>Savio Babu</strong><br/>
    Director, XAVIRGIN (OPC) PRIVATE LIMITED
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 8px; padding-top: 6px; border-top: 1px dashed #666666; font-size: 9pt;">
    <strong>Acknowledgment by Intern:</strong><br/>
    I, <strong>{{ doc.candidate_name }}</strong>, have read, understood, and agree to the terms of this offer letter, leave/extension policies, certificate issuance terms, and all Company policies linked above (Legal Notice, Privacy Policy, Workplace Policy, and Terms &amp; Conditions). I understand that this is an unpaid, learning-focused internship.
    <div class="xav-sig-row">
      <div>____________________________________<br/><strong>Candidate Signature ({{ doc.candidate_name }})</strong></div>
      <div style="text-align: right;">________________________<br/><strong>Date</strong></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="xav-footer">
    Xavirgin.com — Official Remote Internship Offer &amp; Policy | Page 1 of 2
  </div>

  <!-- PAGE 2: NON-DISCLOSURE AGREEMENT -->
  <div class="page-break"></div>
  <div class="xav-header" style="margin-top: 10px;">
    <div class="xav-company-title">XAVIRGIN (OPC) PRIVATE LIMITED</div>
    <p class="xav-company-sub">8/372, Ground Floor, Valiyaparambil, Edathala, Aluva, Ernakulam, Kerala - 683561 | CIN: U62090KL2025OPC098558</p>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin: 24px 0 18px 0;">
    <h3 style="margin: 0; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline;">NON-DISCLOSURE AGREEMENT</h3>
    <p style="margin: 4px 0 0 0; font-style: italic; font-size: 10pt;">Strictly Confidential</p>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 1.6; text-align: justify;">
    This Non-Disclosure Agreement (the "Agreement") is entered into on this <strong><u>{{ day_num }}{{ suffix }}</u></strong> day of <strong><u>{{ issue_dt.strftime('%B') }}</u></strong>, <strong><u>{{ issue_dt.strftime('%Y') }}</u></strong>, by and between:
  </p>

  <p style="font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 1.6; text-align: justify; margin-top: 14px;">
    <strong>XAVIRGIN (OPC) PRIVATE LIMITED</strong>, having its registered office at 8/372, Ground Floor, Valiyaparambil, Edathala, Aluva, Ernakulam, Kerala - 683561, India (hereinafter referred to as the <strong>"Company"</strong>);
  </p>

  <p style="text-align: center; font-weight: bold; margin: 12px 0;">AND</p>

  <p style="font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 1.6; text-align: justify;">
    <strong>{{ doc.candidate_name }}</strong>{% if doc.candidate_address %}, residing at {{ doc.candidate_address }}{% endif %} (hereinafter referred to as the <strong>"Recipient"</strong>).
  </p>

  <div style="margin-top: 22px; font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 1.6; text-align: justify;">
    <h4 style="margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;">1. Obligations of Confidentiality</h4>
    <p style="margin-top: 0;">
      The Recipient agrees to maintain all technical source code, credentials, system architecture, product roadmaps, client data, and business strategies in strict confidence and shall not reproduce, distribute, or share Company data with third parties or on public code repositories.
    </p>

    <h4 style="margin-bottom: 4px; margin-top: 16px; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;">2. Intellectual Property &amp; Governance</h4>
    <p style="margin-top: 0;">
      All work products, source code, designs, documentation, and tools developed during the Internship belong exclusively to Xavirgin (OPC) Private Limited. All engagements are subject to the policies specified at <a href="https://xavirgin.com/terms-and-conditions">xavirgin.com/terms-and-conditions</a> and <a href="https://xavirgin.com/workplace-policy">xavirgin.com/workplace-policy</a>.
    </p>

    <h4 style="margin-bottom: 4px; margin-top: 16px; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;">3. Governing Law &amp; Jurisdiction</h4>
    <p style="margin-top: 0;">
      This Agreement shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of India. Courts at Ernakulam, Kerala shall have exclusive jurisdiction over any disputes arising hereunder.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="xav-sig-row" style="margin-top: 65px; font-size: 10.5pt;">
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <strong>For XAVIRGIN (OPC) PRIVATE LIMITED</strong><br/><br/><br/><br/>
      ____________________________________<br/>
      <strong>Savio Babu</strong><br/>
      Director
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <strong>Recipient (Intern)</strong><br/><br/><br/><br/>
      ____________________________________<br/>
      <strong>{{ doc.candidate_name }}</strong><br/>
      Date: ________________________
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="xav-footer" style="margin-top: 80px;">
    xavirgin.com | contact@xavirgin.com | Offer Ref: {{ doc.name }} | Page 2 of 2
  </div>
</div>
